      "cooked": "<p>Unsurprising that they went for a pretty easy match after all those Ultimates.  Anytime I have Visionary against Omnitron, it’s almost certain to be a Mint, and this was no exception.  A few rough plays did seem to fulfill the promise of the flavor text, but overall it was nothing a high-powered team like this couldn’t handle.  Eager to have a more challenging battle again next week maybe.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e5c0d9dc305e32a164845866f7c605419eff7e78.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/e5c0d9dc305e32a164845866f7c605419eff7e78\" title=\"Screenshot_20220208-183343\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e5c0d9dc305e32a164845866f7c605419eff7e78_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220208-183343\" data-base62-sha1=\"wMuwn40fA7UMIppCkgNOtxpHvja\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e5c0d9dc305e32a164845866f7c605419eff7e78_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e5c0d9dc305e32a164845866f7c605419eff7e78_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e5c0d9dc305e32a164845866f7c605419eff7e78_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e5c0d9dc305e32a164845866f7c605419eff7e78_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220208-183343</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 92 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
