      "id": 242597,
      "name": "",
      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-02-10T16:12:57.901Z",
      "cooked": "<p>One thing I was very careful about in my game was to finish the last Drone first and then Omnitron, even though this was slightly suboptimal, because I didn’t want to get the “you haven’t won yet” popup message for no real reason a split-second before the game end.  Those popups are exciting when they actually matter, but that’s not something the computer knows how to arbitrate.</p>",
